<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN GAS SUSPENDED ON VILNIUS BOURSE.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN GAS SUSPENDED ON VILNIUS BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's stock exchange said on Tuesday that its board decided to suspend trade in the securities of Lithuanian Gas from July 7 to July 11 at issuers' request because of its upcoming shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>The bourse also said in a statement that it decided to suspend trade in the shares of Ukio Bank from July 14 to July 22 for the same reason.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
